{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00377","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀圜丘乐章 凯安 · 褚亮","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀圜丘乐章 凯安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔在炎运终，中华乱无象。\n酆郊赤乌见，邙山黑云上。\n大赉下周车，禁暴开殷网。\n幽明同叶赞，鼎祚齐天壤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}